<title>USA: NYC water auth to sell debt Thursday - city official.</title>
<headline>NYC water auth to sell debt Thursday - city official.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York City Municipal Water Finance Authority, which delayed a $371 million bond sale that was preliminarily set for Wednesday, said that it would go ahead with the sale on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We'll be pricing first thing in the morning,&quot; said a city official.</p>
</text>
